  "merger_description": "Herron Todd White (Bidco) Pty Ltd (**HTW Bidco**) proposes to acquire 100% of the issued share capital in Valuation Services (Qld) Pty Ltd (**VSQ**) from 4 individual directors / shareholders of VSQ.\n\nHerron Todd White (Holdings) Pty Ltd (**HTW Holdings**) is the ultimate parent company of HTW Bidco. HTW Holdings and its connected entities (collectively, the **HTW Group**) provide property valuation and related property advisory services throughout Australia. HTW Group\u2019s core service offering comprises residential, commercial and agribusiness property valuation services, supplied principally to Australian authorised deposit-taking institutions such as the major banks and other financial institutions, as well as to government agencies, property developers, legal practitioners and private clients. HTW Group is majority-owned by funds managed by QPE No. 7 Management Pty Ltd, an entity within the Quadrant Private Equity group.\n\nVSQ is a privately owned valuation practice that provides commercial, institutional and specialist property valuation services throughout Queensland.\n\nVSQ traded as \u2018Knight Frank Valuation & Advisory Queensland\u2019 and \u2018Knight Frank Health and Aged Care Queensland\u2019 from 2019 to June 2026.\n\nVSQ currently operates under a licence from HTW Group and trades as Herron Todd White Institutional, resides in HTW Group\u2019s Brisbane offices and operates on HTW Group\u2019s network and systems.",
